  (text "2xAA (external holder, JST-PH). Reverse polarity: Q1 DMG2305UX in the + lead, gate to GND through R1.\nReversed cells: body diode blocked, VGS = 0, FET off. At 1.8 V: RDS(on) <= 200 mOhm (DMG2305UX ds p.2)."
    (at 30 28 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "07a165d4-edd4-4bc7-bcdb-d9e97479fb20")
  )
  (text "3.3 V boost TPS61099 (adjustable): VOUT = 1.0 V x (1 + (R2+R3)/R4) = 3.30 V (ds p.15 eq.1, VREF p.5).\nShutdown (EN low) disconnects VOUT from VIN: 'the rectifying PMOS fully turns off' (ds p.11). IQ 0.4 uA VIN + 0.6 uA VOUT (p.5).\nFB divider 3.3 MOhm = 1.0 uA. L1 2.2 uH, COUT 2x10 uF (ds p.6, p.14)."
    (at 100 28 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "cb35bf33-e77b-49ef-8bfd-2ce6de8994c5")
  )
  (text "Soft latch: button or HOLD (PA1) pulls EN high through D1 (BAT54C, common cathode). R6 2M holds EN low when both are low.\nOFF: nothing biased -> leakage = boost shutdown 0.5 uA typ (ds p.5) + FET IDSS. Press at VBAT 1.8 V: EN >= 1.7 V > VIH 1.2 V (ds p.6).\nEN leakage 50 nA max x 2M = 0.1 V < VIL 0.4 V, so EN still reads low. PA3 (FT pin, DS10668 p.40) reads the button through R7 100k."
    (at 30 112 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "2c8abbe3-ffe2-48ff-8ac9-4b6055ad2e56")
  )
  (text "STM32L031F6P6: Stop + RTC ~0.55 uA at 3 V (DS10668 Fig.18 p.63). SWD on Tag-Connect TC2030-NL.\nLSE: Epson FC-135 7 pF, C0 1.0 pF, ESR 70 kOhm typ (FC-135 spec p.2).\ngm_crit = 4 ESR (2 pi f)^2 (C0+CL)^2 = 0.76 uA/V < 1.7 uA/V (LSEDRV medium-high, DS10668 Table 40 p.71).\nCL = C9 C10/(C9+C10) + Cstray = 3.4 + ~3.5 pF (assumed) = 6.9 pF -> C9 = C10 = 6.8 pF."
    (at 150 130 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "12a49f53-c674-460e-ba86-d33fa50d5ab8")
  )
  (text "Battery sense: Q3 high-side switch, on only while PA5 drives Q4. Off: no divider current, and no\npath from VBAT into PA4 while the MCU is unpowered. Divider 1:2 -> PA4 <= 1.8 V."
    (at 285 28 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "3eecf2ee-aa51-4899-84ef-1fbbac1a07a3")
  )
  (text "Buzzer MLT-8530 (16 Ohm, 2.7 kHz) driven as in its spec p.3: 470 R base, 1N4148 across the coil.\nR14 keeps Q5 off while PA6 floats at reset."
    (at 285 118 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "c8b874e7-a053-4c44-948a-7a6d9df6d2dc")
  )
